{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3243804,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Jean Pierre Thill","original_name":"Jean Pierre Thill","popularity":0.1102,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8vEmTDHWbvbojnOqFOTJYCyYH7B.jpg","id":370405,"title":"Wann ist der Mann ein Mann?","original_title":"Wann ist der Mann ein Mann?","overview":"While his wife Linda jets through the world as a pilot, the architect Jan Weber takes care of the son as a full-time houseman. When Jan unexpectedly slips into an affair with the equally successful and attractive businesswoman Sophie Berger, who also makes a comeback in his professional life, Jan faces a difficult decision: Will he continue to stay a houseman or return to work as a \"real man\"?","poster_path":"/dstfBlWKzxaj75soBNZCyOWa9IM.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"de","genre_ids":[35],"popularity":0.5846,"release_date":"2002-10-04","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":2}]},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":5000752,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Jean Pierre","original_name":"Jean Pierre","popularity":0.0728,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":500279,"title":"Bandeira de Retalhos","original_title":"Bandeira de Retalhos","overview":"Vidigal Hill, 1977. A runaway group of bandits engage in a complex love triangle in the brink of the news that the corrupt Rio de Janeiro mayor decided to make everyone move out of Vidigal, aided by police forces.","poster_path":"/9VFuX16rNeY1qHOKkY6qWb5iUAV.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pt","genre_ids":[18],"popularity":0.9582,"release_date":"2018-01-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0}]},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1201231,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Jean Pierre Camps","original_name":"Jean Pierre Camps","popularity":0.2189,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/yDoxGhbraztYnY8oyyK5